## Confirmed mechanisms (all verified in-account)
- ✅ Set-period wait (burn prepaid month)
- ✅ "Current Day of month" If/Else condition with is-on-or-before operator
- ✅ "Until a recurring window opens" wait — Monthly, single day-of-month
- ✅ "Send recurring invoice" action with Start=Action Date, End=Never, Autopayment ON

